<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime"
                    xmlns:conv="clr-namespace:PermaLocke.App.Converters">

    <!-- Conversores compartidos. Estaban declarados vista por vista, asi que cada pantalla que
         los necesitaba se los volvia a inventar; desde aqui los tiene toda la aplicacion. -->
    <BooleanToVisibilityConverter x:Key="BoolToVisibility" />
    <conv:ResourceKeyConverter x:Key="ResourceKey" />
    <conv:InverseBoolToVisibilityConverter x:Key="InverseBoolToVisibility" />

    <!-- Sube al tema porque ya lo usan dos pantallas: es la unica forma de dimensionar por
         proporcion en WPF sin saber antes el ancho, y eso hace falta en mas de un sitio. -->
    <conv:FractionToStarConverter x:Key="FractionToStar" />
    <conv:DisplayNameConverter x:Key="DisplayName" />

    <!--
        ============================================================================================
        COMPONENTES DE PERMALOCKE
        ============================================================================================

        Los tokens están en Palette.xaml; aquí se convierten en las piezas con las que se montan las
        pantallas. Ninguna vista debería inventarse una pieza: si hace falta una nueva, se añade
        aquí y la usan todas.

        ==========================================================================================
        LOS CUATRO MATERIALES, que es la parte que de verdad cambia cómo se ve la aplicación
        ==========================================================================================

        El problema medido antes de esto: 29 usos de un mismo contenedor con borde. Todo era una
        tarjeta — un dato suelto, un párrafo de ayuda, una lista, un botón — y una pantalla donde
        todo está encajonado no tiene jerarquía, tiene ruido. Es además la marca más reconocible
        de una interfaz hecha de plantilla.

        Ahora hay cuatro materiales y cada uno tiene un trabajo:

          Section   NADA. Un rótulo y aire. Es el material POR DEFECTO: la mayoría de los bloques
                    no necesitan caja, necesitan estar separados. Se agrupa con espacio, no con
                    bordes.
          Inset     Un plano un escalón por encima del fondo, SIN BORDE. Para agrupar de verdad.
                    Como es la clave que usaban esos 29 sitios, redefinirla aquí desencajona la
                    aplicación entera sin tocar una sola vista.
          Well      Hundido, más oscuro que el fondo. Para listas, historiales e inventarios:
                    lo que en un juego es la ranura donde caen las cosas.
          Card      Con borde y relieve. SOLO para objetos: un Pokémon, un artículo de la tienda,
                    un logro. Si tiene borde, es una cosa que se puede coger.

        La elevación la da el escalón de gris, no una sombra. Por eso no hay ni una sombra en todo
        el fichero: son caras de dibujar y en un tema oscuro apenas se ven.
    -->

    <!-- ==================================================================== TIPOGRAFÍA -->

    <!--
        Siete tamaños y tres familias, y cada estilo dice para qué sirve. Antes había 25 tamaños
        sueltos repartidos por las vistas, que no es una jerarquía sino veinticinco.

        Bahnschrift para cifras y rótulos, Segoe para lo que se lee en frases. La regla de cuándo
        toca cada una: si es un DATO, va en Bahnschrift; si es una FRASE, en Segoe.
    -->

    <!-- El número grande: saldo, contadores. Cifras tabulares para que no baile al cambiar. -->
    <Style x:Key="Display" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeHuge}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Typography.NumeralAlignment" Value="Tabular" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="SectionTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeTitle}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <!--
        El rótulo de sección. Es la pieza que sustituye a media docena de cajas: en vez de meter el
        bloque en un marco, se le pone nombre. Espaciado entre letras porque en tamaño pequeño y en
        mayúsculas es lo que lo hace legible y lo que le da el aire de panel de instrumentos.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="PanelHeading" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="StatLabel" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource PanelHeading}">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeMicro}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="CardTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeLead}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Cualquier cifra dentro de una fila. Tabular para que las columnas cuadren. -->
    <Style x:Key="StatValue" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeTitle}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Typography.NumeralAlignment" Value="Tabular" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="Numeric" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource StatValue}">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Lo que se lee en frases. Interlineado holgado: se consulta de un vistazo y a menudo de reojo. -->
    <Style x:Key="Body" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap" />
        <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="19" />
        <Setter Property="LineStackingStrategy" Value="BlockLineHeight" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="Muted" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Body}">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="Faint" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Body}">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="Mono" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Body}">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource MonoFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeSmall}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- ==================================================================== MATERIALES -->

    <!--
        El contenedor de una pantalla entera. Uno por vista como mucho: es el suelo del contenido,
        no una tarjeta.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="Panel" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource PanelBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusLarge}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadPanelWide}" />
    </Style>

    <!--
        SIN BORDE, y esa es toda la diferencia. Esta clave se usa en 29 sitios, así que quitarle el
        marco aquí es lo que desencajona la aplicación entera de una vez. Lo que agrupa ahora es
        que el plano esté un escalón por encima, no una línea alrededor.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="Inset" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceAltBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadPanel}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Hundido. La ranura donde caen las cosas: listas, historial, inventario. -->
    <Style x:Key="Well" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SunkenBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadPanel}" />
    </Style>

    <!--
        Un OBJETO: algo que se coge, se compra o se mira de cerca. Es el único material con borde,
        y por eso el borde vuelve a significar algo.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="Card" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceAltBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderSubtleBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadPanel}" />
        <Style.Triggers>
            <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}" />
                <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderBrush}" />
            </Trigger>
        </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>

    <!--
        La barra de acento a la izquierda de un bloque. Es el recurso de menú de juego para decir
        «esto de aquí» sin encender un marco entero, y sale más barato de leer que un borde.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="Rail" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Width" Value="3" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="Divider" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Height" Value="1" />
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource BorderSubtleBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Fila de lista: se separan por una línea abajo, no metiendo cada una en su caja. -->
    <Style x:Key="Row" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderSubtleBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,0,0,1" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,10" />
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
    </Style>

    <!-- ==================================================================== DISTINTIVOS -->

    <!--
        Los semánticos viven aquí y solo aquí: pequeños, con fondo teñido y borde de su familia.
        Nunca un relleno grande de color — es lo que convierte una interfaz en un semáforo.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="Chip" TargetType="Border">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
        <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="7,3" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipText" TargetType="TextBlock">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeMicro}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipAccent" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource Chip}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentDeepBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipSuccess" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource Chip}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SuccessDeepBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource SuccessBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipWarning" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource Chip}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource WarningDeepBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource WarningBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipDanger" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource Chip}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource DangerDeepBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource DangerBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ChipInfo" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource Chip}">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource InfoDeepBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource InfoBrush}" />
    </Style>

    <!-- ==================================================================== NAVEGACIÓN -->

    <!--
        Cada sección con su icono y su barra de acento al seleccionarse. Antes era una lista de
        palabras: se leía, no se reconocía, y en algo que se usa cientos de horas la diferencia
        entre leer y reconocer es toda.

        El fondo del seleccionado sube un escalón y aparece la barra. No hay degradado ni brillo:
        una pestaña de menú es una pestaña, se ve hundida o levantada.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="NavItem" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
        <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem">
                    <Grid x:Name="Root" Background="Transparent" Height="38">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="4" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

                        <Border x:Name="Bar" Grid.Column="0" Background="Transparent"
                                CornerRadius="0,3,3,0" Margin="0,6" />

                        <Border x:Name="Fill" Grid.Column="1" Background="Transparent"
                                CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}" Margin="6,1,10,1">
                            <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0" />
                        </Border>
                    </Grid>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Fill" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Fill" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceAltBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Bar" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ==================================================================== BOTONES -->

    <!--
        Tres pesos y no más: la acción de la pantalla, las demás, y la destructiva. Alto fijo de
        32 px, que es tamaño de herramienta. Un botón grande no es más importante, solo es más
        grande, y llena la pantalla de bultos.

        El primario va relleno de latón porque el latón es «esto vale y esto se pulsa». Como
        consecuencia solo debería haber UNO por pantalla; los demás van fantasma.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="PrimaryButton" TargetType="Button">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource DisplayFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource OnAccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadControl}" />
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="32" />
        <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
        <Setter Property="SnapsToDevicePixels" Value="True" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome"
                            Background="{StaticResource AccentBrush}"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}"
                            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
                        <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                          TextElement.Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrightBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextDisabledBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="GhostButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome"
                            Background="Transparent"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}"
                            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
                        <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                          TextElement.Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderSubtleBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextDisabledBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!--
        Destructiva. Va fantasma con el borde rojo y no rellena: un botón rojo macizo pide que lo
        pulses, y este es justo el que no.
    -->
    <Style x:Key="DangerButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource GhostButton}">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource DangerBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome"
                            Background="Transparent"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource DangerDeepBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}"
                            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
                        <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                          TextElement.Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource DangerDeepBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource DangerBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextDisabledBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource BorderSubtleBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- Botón de fila: para acciones dentro de una lista, donde uno normal pesaría demasiado. -->
    <Style x:Key="SubtleButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource GhostButton}">
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="{StaticResource PadTight}" />
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="26" />
    </Style>

    <!-- Un botón sin estilo explícito sigue teniendo la cara de la casa. -->
    <Style TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}" />
    <!-- ============================================================ INPUT -->

    <Style x:Key="Field" TargetType="TextBox">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="CaretBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="SelectionBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,7" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome"
                            Background="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}"
                            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
                        <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ContentHost" Focusable="False"
                                      HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden"
                                      VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocusWithin" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource SurfaceBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="TextBox" BasedOn="{StaticResource Field}" />

    <!-- The stock ComboBox is Windows chrome; unstyled it punches a light hole in the theme. -->
    <Style x:Key="ComboToggle" TargetType="ToggleButton">
        <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False" />
        <Setter Property="ClickMode" Value="Press" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome"
                            Background="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}">
                        <Path x:Name="Arrow"
                              HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                              Margin="0,0,10,0"
                              Data="M 0 0 L 4 4 L 8 0"
                              Stroke="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" StrokeThickness="1.6" />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Arrow" Property="Stroke" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Arrow" Property="Stroke" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,7" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome" Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}" Margin="3,1">
                        <ContentPresenter />
                    </Border>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsHighlighted" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentDeepBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrightBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="ComboBox">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <!-- Misma altura que un TextBox con el estilo Field, para que una fila con un campo y
             un desplegable no salga escalonada. -->
        <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="34" />
        <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBox">
                    <Grid>
                        <ToggleButton Style="{StaticResource ComboToggle}"
                                      IsChecked="{Binding IsDropDownOpen, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}" />

                        <ContentPresenter x:Name="Selection" Margin="10,0,26,0"
                                          VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                          IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                          Content="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItem}"
                                          ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItemTemplate}" />

                        <!--
                            The typing surface of an editable ComboBox. WPF looks this part up by
                            name and wires the text search to it, so a retemplated ComboBox without
                            it silently stops accepting typing — which is how the species picker is
                            used, so it has to be here.

                            It sits on top of the toggle button with a transparent background,
                            which is hit-testable: clicks on the text land in the box, clicks on
                            the arrow fall through to the button underneath and open the list.
                        -->
                        <TextBox x:Name="PART_EditableTextBox"
                                 Margin="10,0,26,0" Padding="0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                 Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0"
                                 Foreground="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                 CaretBrush="{StaticResource AccentBrush}"
                                 SelectionBrush="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}"
                                 IsReadOnly="{TemplateBinding IsReadOnly}"
                                 Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <TextBox.Template>
                                <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
                                    <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ContentHost" Focusable="False"
                                                  HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden"
                                                  VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" />
                                </ControlTemplate>
                            </TextBox.Template>
                        </TextBox>

                        <Popup x:Name="PART_Popup"
                               IsOpen="{TemplateBinding IsDropDownOpen}"
                               Placement="Bottom" AllowsTransparency="True"
                               PopupAnimation="Fade" Focusable="False">
                            <Border Background="{StaticResource SurfaceAltBrush}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusMedium}"
                                    Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                    MinWidth="{TemplateBinding ActualWidth}"
                                    MaxHeight="{TemplateBinding MaxDropDownHeight}">
                                <ScrollViewer>
                                    <ItemsPresenter Margin="0,4" />
                                </ScrollViewer>
                            </Border>
                        </Popup>
                    </Grid>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEditable" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="PART_EditableTextBox" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Selection" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="IBeam" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Arrow" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="CheckBox">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
                    <!-- Rejilla y no una pila horizontal: en una pila el contenido mide con ancho
                         infinito, así que un texto largo nunca ajusta línea y se sale de la ventana. -->
                    <Grid Background="Transparent">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Border x:Name="Box" Grid.Column="0" Width="17" Height="17"
                                Background="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="1"
                                CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}"
                                VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}">
                            <Path x:Name="Tick" Data="M 0 4 L 3.2 7.2 L 9 1"
                                  Stroke="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}" StrokeThickness="2"
                                  StrokeEndLineCap="Round" StrokeStartLineCap="Round"
                                  HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                  Visibility="Collapsed" />
                        </Border>
                        <ContentPresenter Grid.Column="1" Margin="9,0,0,0"
                                          VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
                    </Grid>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Tick" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Arrow" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="RadioButton">
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeBody}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
        <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
                    <!-- Misma razón que en CheckBox: con una pila horizontal el texto no ajusta. -->
                    <Grid Background="Transparent">
                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                        <Grid Grid.Column="0" Width="17" Height="17"
                              VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}">
                            <Ellipse x:Name="Ring"
                                     Fill="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}"
                                     Stroke="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}" StrokeThickness="1" />
                            <Ellipse x:Name="Dot" Width="8" Height="8"
                                     Fill="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" Visibility="Collapsed" />
                        </Grid>
                        <ContentPresenter Grid.Column="1" Margin="9,0,0,0"
                                          VerticalAlignment="{TemplateBinding VerticalContentAlignment}" />
                    </Grid>

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Ring" Property="Stroke" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Ring" Property="Stroke" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                            <Setter TargetName="Dot" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextFaintBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Arrow" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ============================================================ PROGRESS -->

    <!--
        Rounded track and rounded fill. The fill is clipped by the track's own corner radius, so a
        bar at 2% shows a sliver rather than a square peg sticking out of a rounded box.
    -->
    <Style TargetType="ProgressBar">
        <Setter Property="Height" Value="7" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ProgressBar">
                    <Border Background="{StaticResource BackgroundBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource BorderBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="4"
                            ClipToBounds="True">
                        <Grid>
                            <Rectangle x:Name="PART_Track" Fill="Transparent" />
                            <Rectangle x:Name="PART_Indicator"
                                       HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                       Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}"
                                       RadiusX="3" RadiusY="3" />
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ============================================================ BARRA DE TITULO -->

    <!-- Los botones de la ventana. Anchos y sin borde, como los de Windows, porque el gesto de
         cerrar se hace a ciegas contra la esquina y un boton pequeño ahi es una trampa. -->
    <Style x:Key="CaptionButton" TargetType="Button">
        <Setter Property="Width" Value="44" />
        <Setter Property="Height" Value="37" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextMutedBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome" Background="Transparent">
                        <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background"
                                    Value="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- Cerrar se pone rojo, que es lo que todo el mundo espera de ese sitio. -->
    <Style x:Key="CaptionButtonClose" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource CaptionButton}">
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
                    <Border x:Name="Chrome" Background="Transparent">
                        <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chrome" Property="Background"
                                    Value="{StaticResource DangerBrush}" />
                            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ============================================================ SCROLLBARS -->


    <!-- Invisible page-up/page-down areas: the track is the whole bar, only the thumb is drawn. -->
    <Style x:Key="ScrollPageButton" TargetType="RepeatButton">
        <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False" />
        <Setter Property="IsTabStop" Value="False" />
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="RepeatButton">
                    <Border Background="Transparent" />
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style x:Key="ScrollThumb" TargetType="Thumb">
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="Thumb">
                    <Border x:Name="Grip" Background="{StaticResource BorderStrongBrush}"
                            CornerRadius="4" Margin="2" />

                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Grip" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsDragging" Value="True">
                            <Setter TargetName="Grip" Property="Background" Value="{StaticResource AccentBrush}" />
                        </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="ScrollBar">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
        <Setter Property="Width" Value="11" />
        <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="11" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
                    <Grid Background="Transparent">
                        <Track x:Name="PART_Track" IsDirectionReversed="True">
                            <Track.DecreaseRepeatButton>
                                <RepeatButton Style="{StaticResource ScrollPageButton}"
                                              Command="ScrollBar.PageUpCommand" />
                            </Track.DecreaseRepeatButton>
                            <Track.Thumb>
                                <Thumb Style="{StaticResource ScrollThumb}" />
                            </Track.Thumb>
                            <Track.IncreaseRepeatButton>
                                <RepeatButton Style="{StaticResource ScrollPageButton}"
                                              Command="ScrollBar.PageDownCommand" />
                            </Track.IncreaseRepeatButton>
                        </Track>
                    </Grid>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
        <Style.Triggers>
            <Trigger Property="Orientation" Value="Horizontal">
                <Setter Property="Width" Value="Auto" />
                <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="0" />
                <Setter Property="Height" Value="11" />
                <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="11" />
                <Setter Property="Template">
                    <Setter.Value>
                        <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
                            <Grid Background="Transparent">
                                <Track x:Name="PART_Track">
                                    <Track.DecreaseRepeatButton>
                                        <RepeatButton Style="{StaticResource ScrollPageButton}"
                                                      Command="ScrollBar.PageLeftCommand" />
                                    </Track.DecreaseRepeatButton>
                                    <Track.Thumb>
                                        <Thumb Style="{StaticResource ScrollThumb}" />
                                    </Track.Thumb>
                                    <Track.IncreaseRepeatButton>
                                        <RepeatButton Style="{StaticResource ScrollPageButton}"
                                                      Command="ScrollBar.PageRightCommand" />
                                    </Track.IncreaseRepeatButton>
                                </Track>
                            </Grid>
                        </ControlTemplate>
                    </Setter.Value>
                </Setter>
            </Trigger>
        </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>

    <!-- ============================================================ MISC -->

    <Style TargetType="ToolTip">
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{StaticResource TextBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{StaticResource UiFont}" />
        <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{StaticResource FontSizeSmall}" />
        <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="320" />
        <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToolTip">
                    <Border Background="{StaticResource SurfaceHighBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource AccentDimBrush}"
                            BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{StaticResource RadiusSmall}"
                            Padding="10,6">
                        <ContentPresenter />
                    </Border>
                </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
        </Setter>
    </Style>

</ResourceDictionary>
